  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    top_color = grid[0][1]\n    bottom_color = grid[rows-1][1]\n    left_color = grid[1][0]\n    right_color = grid[1][cols-1]\n    \n    result = [[0]*cols for _ in range(rows)]\n    \n    # Copy borders\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            result[r][c] = grid[r][c]\n    \n    # Clear interior\n    for r in range(1, rows-1):\n        for c in range(1, cols-1):\n            result[r][c] = 0\n    \n    # Process interior colored pixels\n    for r in range(1, rows-1):\n        for c in range(1, cols-1):\n            v = grid[r][c]\n            if v == 0:\n                continue\n            if v == top_color:\n                result[1][c] = v\n            elif v == bottom_color:\n                result[rows-2][c] = v\n            elif v == left_color:\n                result[r][1] = v\n            elif v == right_color:\n                result[r][cols-2] = v\n    \n    return result\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    top_color = grid[0][1]\n    bottom_color = grid[rows-1][1]\n    left_color = grid[1][0]\n    right_color = grid[1][cols-1]\n    \n    result = [[0]*cols for _ in range(rows)]\n    \n    # Copy borders\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            result[r][c] = grid[r][c]\n    \n    # Clear interior\n    for r in range(1, rows-1):\n        for c in range(1, cols-1):\n            result[r][c] = 0\n    \n    # Process interior colored pixels\n    for r in range(1, rows-1):\n        for c in range(1, cols-1):\n            v = grid[r][c]\n            if v == 0:\n                continue\n            if v == top_color:\n                result[1][c] = v\n            elif v == bottom_color:\n                result[rows-2][c] = v\n            elif v == left_color:\n                result[r][1] = v\n            elif v == right_color:\n                result[r][cols-2] = v\n    \n    return result",
